        "collapsible_tab_rmVpDh": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Details",
            "content": "<p><strong>Breescape. Built to sleep through.</strong></p><p>The best stay-in-place cooling mattress topper for hot sleepers, with <strong>instant cooling, breathable comfort, responsive-yet-cushiony foam with no sink-in feeling, and a secure fit that stays put all night</strong>. </p><p>A breathable foam core moves with your body, not against it, while the cool-touch knit surface feels instantly refreshing the moment you lie down. Unlike traditional memory foam, which can feel dense and slow, it offers support that's light, bouncy, and gentle, without heat buildup, so comfort stays consistent all night. Finished with a secure fit that stays in place all night:</p><ul><li>3\" Cushioning for Added Comfort</li><li>Anti-Slip Grip Dots on the Bottom</li><li>4 Secure Corner Straps</li><li>3-Side Zipper Closure</li></ul><p><strong>Safe & Skin-Friendly: </strong>Every item bearing the OEKO-TEX® STANDARD 100 label is certified as having passed safety tests for harmful substances.</p>",
            "page": "",
